                            "description": "Type of event, from the perspective of the receiving bank:\n  * ORDER_ACCEPTED - the order is now associated with your bank, either because it became\n    actionable or because its bank was switched to you.\n  * ORDER_UPDATED - an order already associated with your bank changed.\n  * ORDER_DELETED - the order is no longer associated with your bank, because it was cancelled\n    or its bank was switched away from you.\n",
                            "example": "ORDER_UPDATED",
